@startuml
title NC2 — SO17 / revised CO17 Cancel appointment
skinparam shadowing false
actor "Administrative Staff" as Staff
participant ":AppointmentTrackingSystem" as System
Staff -> System : cancelAppointment(appointment)
alt cancellable appointment owns its occupied slot
  alt eligible patients found after releasing slot/resources
    System --> Staff : cancelled details; OPEN slot; candidates in priority order
  else no eligible patients
    System --> Staff : cancelled details; OPEN slot; empty candidate list
  end
else unknown, already cancelled, arrived/completed or inconsistent occupancy
  System --> Staff : cancellation refused; no state change
end
note over System
  Retain historical appointment and referral links.
  No automatic telephone offer or replacement booking.
  Candidate lookup follows CO28 without another actor event.
end note
@enduml
